      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open Timelines",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In the <strong>Inbox</strong>, tap <strong>Timelines</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/53546c2fdd1aa0c8.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Read the time axis",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>Direct</strong> is what reached your phone straight from others. Use <strong>−</strong> and <strong>+</strong> to see more or less time.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e0f6c967430dce64.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open a lane",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Direct</strong> to see its reports along the time axis. Where there is room, a report names who added it, such as <strong>By BRAVO-2</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/67672f473a49a365.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See a busy moment",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Where reports crowd, tap the count to list them. The list says what was new or removed, when and by whom.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/229311b373997ee0.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Go to it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap a report for its details. <strong>Close and go to</strong> flies the map there.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1c1df7fc56776f22.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Reach further back",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Close every sheet, then tap <strong>≡</strong> and <strong>OpenDefence Main</strong>. <strong>Timeline history</strong> sets how far back Timelines reach.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0cdf283125f8da1c.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
